        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;CATATAN OTOMATIS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Trigger memperbarui updated_at.&lt;br&gt;• Soft-delete project menonaktifkan device, notification channel, dan alert rule.&lt;br&gt;• Soft-delete device menonaktifkan alert rule.&lt;br&gt;• Trigger history mengisi project_id, device_id, channel_id, dan rule_snapshot.&lt;br&gt;• View active_alert_rules: hanya rule aktif, project/device aktif, channel numeric.&lt;br&gt;• View active_alert_rule_targets: hanya target notification channel aktif." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
